      "created_at": "2018-09-13T19:09:48.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The bickering was fun, but I feel that way too much of it was spent on \"what, exactly, counts as a doomsday scenario?\" which, IMO, should have been determined before they started recording, and also SIGNIFICANTLY lowerend the number of doomsday plots we could have gotten.</p>\n<p>That was my only real complaint.&nbsp; And, yeah, LOVE the robot scenario we DID get.</p>",
