      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/l/f4b2a3/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2025-10-08T17:17:56.100Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I didn’t expect that the Kansas City discussion was going to be like the funniest thing I heard all week.</p>\n<p>“You don’t use a doomsay device to blow up Albuquerque.”. Clearly Adam has not contemplated the possibility of Iron Bugs Bunny getting vengeance for all those left turns.</p>",
